DEFINITIONS

"Software" refers to the EcoDrive application, including all source
code, compiled binaries, assets, documentation, datasets, algorithms,
AI prompts, model configurations, and any other files contained in
this repository.

"Core Team" refers exclusively and collectively to the four individuals
named above. No other person, entity, organisation, or AI system is
or may become a member of the Core Team under any circumstance,
including by employment, assignment, contribution, or court order,
without the unanimous written consent of all four named members.

"User" refers to any individual or entity that downloads, installs,
or runs the Software.

