  (c) DISTRIBUTION: No person outside the Core Team may publish,
      upload, share, mirror, host, transmit, broadcast, or otherwise
      distribute the Software or any copy thereof, whether in original
      or modified form, through any medium or channel, including but
      not limited to app stores, file-sharing platforms, package
      registries, cloud storage, or physical media.

  (d) COMMERCIAL USE: No person outside the Core Team may use the
      Software or any portion thereof for any commercial purpose,
      including but not limited to: selling access to the Software,
      incorporating it into a paid product or service, using it to
      generate revenue directly or indirectly, or licensing it to
      third parties.

  (e) SUBLICENSING: No User may grant any rights in the Software to
      any other person or entity.

  (f) REVERSE ENGINEERING FOR REDISTRIBUTION: No User may
      decompile, disassemble, or reverse-engineer the Software for
